'''Haute Horror''' (おしゃれクレイジー ''Oshare Kureijī'', '''Stylish Crazy''') is the 34th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 132nd sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 15.5 Update|Version 15.5]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter starts off with a pretty difficult [[Bristle Bodysuit|first stage]] before taking a nosedive in difficulty, as the rest of these stages here are not noteworthy, and provide little to no difficulty  outside of the [[Thunderous Trilby|fifth stage]], which is pretty luck reliant.

